# The rule above is for stray copies out of downloaded packages; the
# repository CHANGELOG.txt is a source file (the page embeds it and the
# packages ship it), and on a case-insensitive filesystem the rule
# would swallow it silently.
!/CHANGELOG.txt
config/local.toml
firmware/*.hex
firmware/INSTALLED.txt
ghidra_project/
otherfirmware/
web/*.hex
web/font/
web/kit/
# Buchla's windows/ folder is vendor drop except the three tools the flasher
# runs, which were force-added; the launcher/ sources and its built exe are
# ours and tracked.  A directory a pattern excludes cannot have files
# re-included, so the folders come back first, then their junk goes again.
windows/*
!windows/support/
windows/support/*
!windows/launcher/
windows/launcher/*
!windows/launcher/launcher.c
!windows/launcher/launcher.rc
!windows/launcher/AppIcon.svg
!windows/launcher/AppIcon.ico
